          <a href="index.html" class="brand"><span class="brand-mark"><i class="fa-solid fa-bolt"></i></span><span>Hetvik<b>Apps</b></span></a>
          <p class="foot-about">A modern Android app studio building fast, elegant and privacy-first mobile experiences that people love to use every day.</p>
          <div class="social-row">
            <a href="#" class="social-btn" aria-label="Twitter / X"><i class="fa-brands fa-x-twitter"></i></a>
            <a href="#" class="social-btn" aria-label="GitHub"><i class="fa-brands fa-github"></i></a>
            <a href="#" class="social-btn" aria-label="LinkedIn"><i class="fa-brands fa-linkedin-in"></i></a>
            <a href="#" class="social-btn" aria-label="Google Play"><i class="fa-brands fa-google-play"></i></a>
          </div>
        </div>
